  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Institute Of Banking Personnel Selection (IBPS)</span> has released the Allotment Reserve List for the post of Clerk CSA (Customer Service Associates) 15th XV. The mains exam was conducted on 02 December 2025<strong>. </strong>This recruitment was released for 13533 posts. Applications for the IBPS Clerk CSA 15th (XV) Recruitment 2025 were accepted from August 01, 2025, to August 28, 2025. Candidates who have Qualified for the Mains exam can download their IBPS Clerk CSA 15th Allotment Reserve List 2026 from the link given below.</span></span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Institute of Banking Personnel Selection (IBPS)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">IBPS Clerk CSA 15th Allotment Reserve List 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Starting Date :<strong> 01 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Registration :<strong> 28 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date :<strong> 28 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Date :<strong> 02-03 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET Exam Date<strong> :&nbsp;29 September&nbsp;2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>24 September&nbsp;2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Exam Date <strong>: 04, 05 – 11 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Pre Exam Admit Card : <strong>24 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Result :<strong> 20 November 2025 Available Now</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><mark>Mains Exam Date : <strong>02 December 2025</strong></mark></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Admit Card : <strong>24 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mains result : <strong>02 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Allotment Reserve List : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>15 June 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 850/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST : <strong>Rs. 175/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PH : <strong>Rs. 175/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>IBPS Clerk 15th Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 August 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>20 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>28 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per IBPS Clerk 14th Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>IBPS Clerk 15th 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 13533</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of&nbsp; Post</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Bank Wise Details</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td